# library/

Your device-driver scripts, referenced from pida.yaml run strings
as ./library/<name>/<script>.py. At every server start each .py here
gets its shebang rewritten to the service venv's python and the exec
bit set, so:

    ./library/mydevice/mydevice.py --host "$MY_IP" power

runs under the venv interpreter and its imports resolve against the venv
automatically.
